spec fp02-straggler-abandons-lpg: 2 sessions, 2 permutations
# FP02. s0 writes s and reserves its commit instant (the commit hold); s1 then commits
# t1 and waits, in the background, for its own commit to become visible: the wait is
# parked behind s0 (sessions_waiting = 1). s0 then ABANDONS — the fsync-failure path:
# WriteTx.Abandon, then EndVersionedTx — and the frontier passes its instant: s1's
# wait is released with no error, t1 is visible, s's write is not, and no commit is
# left in flight. The control interleaving abandons before s1 commits.

starting permutation: s0w s0a s1b s1w s1c s1aw s1wait s0x s1rel s1r
step s0w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(s, v, 1)
step s0a: lpg: Graph.AllocateCommitTS (instant reserved, not published)
step s1b: lpg: Session.BeginVersionedTx
step s1w: lpg: AddNode(t1); SetNodeProperty(t1, v, 1)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s1aw: <start lpg: Session.Await in the background>
step s1wait: <background wait: sessions_waiting, returned>
sessions_waiting|returned
----------------+--------
1               |false   
(1 row)
step s0x: lpg: WriteTx.Abandon + Session.EndVersionedTx
step s1rel: <collect the background wait's result>
step s1r: <sessionless> MATCH (n) RETURN labels(n) AS labels, n.name AS name, n.v AS v ORDER BY v, size(labels(n))
labels|name|v
------+----+-
["S"] |"s" |0
[]    |null|1
(2 rows)
final ffr: <MVCCStats: in_flight_commits, sessions_waiting>
in_flight_commits|sessions_waiting
-----------------+----------------
0                |0               
(1 row)

starting permutation: s0w s0a s0x s1b s1w s1c s1aw s1wait s1rel s1r
step s0w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(s, v, 1)
step s0a: lpg: Graph.AllocateCommitTS (instant reserved, not published)
step s0x: lpg: WriteTx.Abandon + Session.EndVersionedTx
step s1b: lpg: Session.BeginVersionedTx
step s1w: lpg: AddNode(t1); SetNodeProperty(t1, v, 1)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s1aw: <start lpg: Session.Await in the background>
step s1wait: <background wait: sessions_waiting, returned>
sessions_waiting|returned
----------------+--------
